<Base title="Equal Housing Opportunity" description="Epique Realty and Jaelly & Dennis Prieto are committed to equal opportunity in housing.">
  <Legal title="Equal Housing Opportunity" intro="Epique Realty and Jaelly & Dennis Prieto are committed to the principles of equal opportunity in housing. We serve every client with fairness, dignity and respect.">
    <h2>A fair and open process</h2>
    <p>We do business in accordance with the federal Fair Housing Act and all applicable state and local fair housing laws. It is illegal to discriminate against any person because of race, color, religion, sex, disability, familial status, national origin, or any other class protected by law, including sexual orientation and gender identity where local law protects them.</p>
    <h2>Our promise to every client</h2>
    <p>Whether you are buying, selling or exploring representation, you receive the same professionalism and care. We do not steer, deny or alter the terms of any real estate service on the basis of a protected characteristic.</p>
    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <p>We want this website to be usable by everyone. If you have difficulty accessing anything here, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> and we will provide the information another way.</p>
    <h2>Reporting a concern</h2>
    <p>If you believe you have experienced housing discrimination, you may file a complaint with the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development at <a href="https://www.hud.gov/fairhousing" rel="noopener">hud.gov/fairhousing</a>.</p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
